<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2806] IGFS: Re-create lock relaxed version</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2806</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Earlier we had IGFS implementation that seemed to be fast, but was not absolutely correct in terms of synchronization logic. As now we suspect some problems with IGFS performance, we need to create such version of the implementation again.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12949086">IGNITE-2806</key>
            <summary>IGFS: Re-create lock relaxed version</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
