                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="15191320" author="vozerov" created="Fri, 11 Mar 2016 18:17:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We should expose a boolean flag to configuration which will let user to choose consistency level - strict or relaxed.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15191324" author="vozerov" created="Fri, 11 Mar 2016 18:18:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Note that in future we will probably avaluate other ideas, e.g. use of ATOMIC cache. As such, it is worth considering use enum instead of boolean flag. On the other hand, we can use boolean flag for simplicity for now, and deprecate it in future if needed.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15200215" author="iveselovskiy" created="Thu, 17 Mar 2016 19:33:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/547&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/547&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15203777" author="vozerov" created="Mon, 21 Mar 2016 06:08:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Ivan,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I think we should better isolate changes and avoid duplication of code (which is already pretty complex).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15203783" author="vozerov" created="Mon, 21 Mar 2016 06:14:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Please find alternative implementation in the branch ignite-2806.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
